      <data key="e_quote">Anheuser-Busch InBev official governance page URL: https://www.ab-inbev.com/board/alexandre-van-damme TITLE: Alexandre Van Damme | Anheuser-Busch InBev Board of Directors RETRIEVED: 2026-11-02  Alexandre Van Damme | Representatives of the Main Shareholders About Us About Us Our Leaders Our Heritage Our Locations What We Do Beer &amp; Brewing Digital Products and Innovation Policies and Principles Reasons We Love Beer Brands Investors Investors Why Invest in ABI? Results Center Results, Reports &amp; Presentations Analysts &amp; Consensus Estimates Investor Contacts Events Center Fixed Income Shareholders Listings ADR Program For US Investors Shareholder Structure Meetings Return of Capital Program Governance ABI Board Of Directors Documents Global Audit Tender Special Board Reports Sustainability News &amp; Media News &amp; Media Press Releases News Stories Media Contacts Careers Working With Us Our Culture Sustainability Sustainability Agriculture Water Energy &amp; Emissions Smart Drinking Smart Drinking Alcohol &amp; Health Road Safety Our website, like our beers, is strictly for those old enough to legally enjoy it. Enter your birthday below Location Belgium Brazil India South Africa United Kingdom United States ────────── Afghanistan Åland Islands Albania Algeria American Samoa Andorra Angola Anguilla Antarctica Antigua &amp; Barbuda Argentina Armenia Aruba Australia Austria Azerbaijan Bahamas Bahrain Bangladesh Barbados Belarus Belize Benin Bermuda Bhutan Bolivia Bosnia &amp; Herzegovina Botswana Bouvet Island British Indian Ocean Territory British Virgin Islands Brunei Bulgaria Burkina Faso Burundi Cambodia Cameroon Canada Cape Verde Caribbean Netherlands Cayman Islands Central African Republic Chad Chile China Christmas Island Cocos (Keeling) Islands Colombia Comoros Congo - Brazzaville Congo - Kinshasa Cook Islands Costa Rica Côte d’Ivoire Croatia Cuba Curaçao Cyprus Czechia Denmark Djibouti Dominica Dominican Republic Ecuador Egyp