ws the independence criteria thus met by the directors concerned.                                                                                           Marianna                      Loïc            Anne-Claire                  Ruby                                                                                            Nitsch                   Rocard               Taittinger        McGregor-Smith Criterion 1      Employee corporate officer during the previous 5 years                          P                       P                        P                        P           |6| Criterion 2      Cross-directorships                                                             P                       P                        P                        P Criterion 3      Significant business relationship                                               P                       P                        P                        P Criterion 4      Family ties                                                                     P                       P                        P                        P Criterion 5      Auditor                                                                         P                       P                        P                        P Criterion 6                                                                                                                                                                                        |7|                  Term of office exceeding 12 years                                               P                       P                        O                        P Criterion 7      Status of non-executive officer                                                 P                       P                        P                        P Criterion 8      Status of major shareholder                                                     P                       P                        P                       