      <data key="e_quote">SAP Investor Relations Ihre Einstellungen zu Cookies für diese Website  Diese Website verwendet Cookies und verwandte Technologien entsprechend der Beschreibung in unserer Cookie-Erklärung, u. A. zum fehlerfreien Betrieb, zur Analyse, für eine verbesserte Benutzerfreundlichkeit oder zu Werbezwecken. Sie können unserer Verwendung dieser Technologien zustimmen oder Ihre eigenen Präferenzen verwalten.  Datenschutzerklärung | Cookie-Erklärung  Alle annehmen Alle ablehnen Einstellungen verwalten Skip to Content Financial Documents &amp; EventsStockNewsGovernance &amp; SustainabilityInvestor ResourcesExplore SAP Contact Us / Governance &amp; Sustainability Supervisory Board Members Committees Profile of Skills and Expertise Qualification Matrix Meeting Participation SAP SE Corporate Governance  SAP SE Supervisory Board  The SAP SE Supervisory Board advises and supervises the Executive Board. The number of members in and the composition of the Supervisory Board are determined by the Articles of Incorporation and the Agreement of the Involvement of the European Employees in SAP SE. SAP's Supervisory Board currently comprises nine members elected by the shareholders at their General Meeting and nine members representing the European employees of the SAP group.  Dr. h. c. mult. Pekka Ala-Pietilae  Chairman of the Supervisory Board SAP SE Chairperson of the Board of Directors of HERE Technologies B.V., Amsterdam, Netherlands  Year of Birth: 1957  Nationality: Finnish  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2027  Learn more about Dr. h. c. mult. Pekka Ala-Pietilae  Lars Lamadé  Deputy Chairperson of the Supervisory Board of SAP SE  Additional Position: Head of Global Sponsorships  Year of Birth: 1971  Nationality: German  First elected: 2002  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Lars Lamadé  Jakub Černý  Demand Manager  Year of Birth: 1982  Nationality: Czech  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Jakub Černý  Pascal Demat  Solution Advisor HCM Member of the SAP SE Works Council (Europe)  Year of Birth: 1967  Nationality: Belgian  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Pascal Demat  Marielle Ehrmann  SVP, Chief Security Officer  Year of Birth: 1983  Nationality: German  First elected: 2026  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Marielle Ehrmann  Aicha Evans  Chief Executive Officer and Member of the Board of Directors, Zoox, Inc., Foster City, California, USA  Year of Birth: 1969  Nationality: U.S. American  First appointed: 2017  Term expires: 2028  Learn more about Aicha Evans  Michael Gregoire  Co-founder and partner of Brighton Park Capital, New York City, New York, USA  Year of Birth: 1965  Nationality: U.S. American and Canadian  First elected: 2026  Term expires: 2030  Learn more about Michael Gregoire  Andreas Hahn</data>
