land), degree: MBA 1984 – 1985: Business Studies at the University of Buckingham (UK), degree: B.Sc.  Status: 01/2026  Jens Köhler Chairman of the Works Council Leipzig Jens Köhler  Chairman of the BMW AG Works Council Leipzig. Employee representative.  Mandate: Member since 2021, elected until 2029 Year of birth: 1964 Nationality: German  Since 2002: Chairman of the BMW AG Works Council Leipzig Since 1993: Member of the Works Council of the BMW branch Chemnitz (Chairman and thus permanent Member of the General Works Council of BMW AG since 1996) 2002: Relocation to BMW Group Plant Leipzig 1996 – 2001: Qualification and car mechanic master craftsman training 1991: Joined BMW AG (Chemnitz branch) Skilled worker training as motor mechanic/locksmith  Status: 01/2026  André Mandl Chairman of the Works Council Regensburg/Wackersdorf André Mandl  Chairman of the BMW AG Works Council Regensburg/Wackersdorf. Employee representative</data>
