      <data key="e_quote">Stellantis Board of Directors is responsible for the Company’s management and strategic direction and is comprised of executive and non-executive members, the majority of whom independent.  John Elkann  Chairman  Executive Director  Antonio Filosa  Chief Executive Officer  Executive Director  Robert Peugeot  Vice Chairman  Non-executive Director  Remuneration Committee Member  Henri de Castries  Senior Independent Director  Chairperson ESG Committee  Audit Committee Member  Remuneration Committee Member  Fiona Clare Cicconi  Non-executive Director  Chairperson Remuneration Committee  ESG Committee Member  Nicolas Dufourcq  Non-executive Director  ESG Committee Member  Juergen Esser  Non-executive Director  Audit Committee Member  Ann Frances Godbehere  Non-executive Director</data>
