res from EPIC Bpifrance on September 5, 2023. By decree dated            January 29, 2024, Mr. Alexis Zajdenweber succeeded Mr. Emmanuel Moulin as the State’s new representative on the Board of Directors.   84   Thales – 2025 Universal Registration Document                                                                                                                Governance and compensation                                                                                                                                 Composition of the Board of Directors    4.1.2 Composition of the Board as of December 31, 2025 a) Summary presentation (in accordance with Appendix III of the Afep-Medef code)  Directors at December 31, 2025                                Age         Gender           Nationality                  Number of              Number of terms of office                                                                                                                        Thales shares                        held in other                                                                                                                                                        listed companies  Appointed by the Annual General Meeting (13)  or by decree (1) (a)  On the proposal of the Public Sector (5)  Patrice Caine,  Chairman and Chief Executive Officer                                                                                                                                                  —                                                                                                                                                                                        —                                                                55          M                French                          25,886 (f)                                      1          —  The French State, represented                                 49          M                French          