      <data key="e_quote">Schneider Electric SE shares throughout his/her term.  Directors are appointed for four-year terms (renewable). However, from the age of 70, Directors are re-elected or appointed for a period of two years. No more than a third of the Directors may be aged 70 or over.  As of July 29, 2026, the Board of Directors comprised 15 members, out of which three are Employee Director or Employee Shareholders’ representative Director, and one Observer:  Jean Pascal Tricoire, Chairman of the Board Fred Kindle, Vice-Chairman &amp; Lead Independent Director Giulia Chierchia, Independent Director Clotilde Delbos, Independent Director Laura Ding, Employee Shareholders' representative Director Rita Félix, Employee Director François Jackow, Independent Director Philippe Knoche, Independent Director Jill Lee, Independent Director Anna Ohlsson-Leijon, Independent Director Abhay Parasnis, Independent Director Anders Runevad, Independent Director Ellyn Shook, Independent Director Lip-Bu Tan, Independent Director Bruno Turchet, Employee Director</data>
