      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.astrazeneca.com/our-company/leadership.html</data>
      <data key="e_quote">AstraZeneca Websites Global site Search Search Search Close What science can do  R&amp;D  Our therapy areas  Our company  Careers  Investors  Media  Sustainability  Partnering  Our leadership Home / Our company / Our leadership Jump to section  Board of Directors  Senior Executive Team Our leadership, which includes our Board of Directors and Senior Executive Team, is accountable to our shareholders for the responsible conduct of the business and our long-term success. It also represents the interests of all our stakeholders in ensuring that we deliver for patients by putting science at the heart of everything we do. Board of Directors Our Directors are collectively responsible for the success of AstraZeneca. In addition, the Non-Executive Directors are responsible for exercising independent and objective judgement and for scrutinising and challenging management. The Board is responsible for setting our strategy and policies, oversight of risk and corporate governance and monitoring progress towards meeting our annual plans. It is accountable to our shareholders for the proper conduct of the business and our long-term success and represents the interests of all stakeholders. The Board has delegated some of its powers to five principal committees and the CEO. Members of the Board and their biographies are shown below. Michel Demaré Non-Executive Chair of the Board Member of the Board since September 2019 and Chair since April 2023. Read biography Pascal Soriot Executive Director and CEO Member of the Board and CEO since October 2012. Read biography Aradhana Sarin Executive Director and CFO Member of the Board and CFO since August 2021. Read biography Philip Broadley Senior independent Non-Executive Director Member of the Board since April 2017 and Senior independent Non-Executive Director since March 2021. Read biography Euan Ashley Non-Executive Director Member of the Board since October 2020. Read biography Birgit Conix Non-Executive Director Member of the Board since February 2025 Read biography Karen Knudsen Non-Executive Director Member of the Board since April 2025. Read biography Diana Layfield Non-Executive Director</data>
    </edge>
