      <data key="e_quote">Siemens Skip to main content Supervisory Board The Supervisory Board of Siemens AG has 20 members. As stipulated by the German Co-determination Act, half of its members represent Company shareholders, and half represent Company employees. Supervisory Board members Jim Hagemann Snabe Chairman Chairman of the Supervisory Board of Siemens AG Member since: October 1, 2013 Biography Jürgen Kerner* First Deputy Chairman Second Chairman of IG Metall Member since: January 25, 2012 Biography Werner Brandt (Dr. rer. pol.) Second Deputy Chairman Second Deputy Chairman of the Supervisory Board of Siemens AG Member since: January 31, 2018 Biography Tobias Bäumler* Chairman of the Central Works Council of Siemens AG Member since: October 16, 2020 Biography Regina E. Dugan (PhD) President and Chief Executive Officer of Wellcome Leap Inc. Member since: February 9, 2023 Biography Andrea Fehrmann (Dr. phil.)* Trade Union Secretary, IG Metall Regional Office for Bavaria Member since: January 31, 2018 Biography Oliver Hartmann* Head of Regional Office Erlangen / Nuremberg, Germany, Chairman of the Committee of Spokespersons of the Siemens Group + Chairman of the Central Committee of Spokespersons of Siemens AG Member since: September 14, 2023 Biography Keryn Lee James Chair of the Board of Directors of OPUS Talent Solutions Ltd. and of Lane Clark &amp; Peacock LLP, Senior Advisor with Bain Capital Management Europe Ltd. Member since: February 9, 2023 Biography Saskia Kraußer* Chairwoman of the Combine Works Council of Siemens AG Member since: February 25, 2025 Biography Stefanie Lengfelder* Deputy Chairwoman of the Central Works Council of Siemens AG Member since: March 5, 2026 Biography Christian Pfeiffer (Dr.-Ing.)* Innovation manager at Siemens Mobility GmbH, member of the Combine Works Council of Siemens AG and of the Central Works Council of Siemens Mobility GmbH Member since: February 9, 2023 Biography Benoît Potier Chairman of the Board of Directors of L'Air Liquide S.A. Member since: January 31, 2018 Biography Hagen Reimer* Trade Union Secretary of the Managing Board of IG Metall Member since: January 30, 2019 Biography Kasper Rørsted Member of supervisory boards Member since: February 3, 2021 Biography Ulf Mark Schneider (Dr. oec.) Member of supervisory boards Member since: February 13, 2025 Biography Nathalie von Siemens (Dr. phil.) Member of supervisory boards Member since: January 27, 2015 Biography Dorothea Simon</data>
