 Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  See more news Group Innovation &amp; technology Sustainable finance Inclusion Corporate philanthropy See more news Mediaroom Menu  Mediaroom  Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  Discover the Mediaroom Press Releases Essentials Spokespeople Contacts Press release BNP Paribas Group: Results as of 30 September 2026 Careers Menu  Careers  Our ambition ? To build a sustainable future. But we can’t do that without you!  Explore our career space  Want to be part of the change?  Why Join BNP Paribas Choosing the right job for me Let's prepare to apply  Choose your profile  I am a student I am early in my career I am an experienced professional Find my future job Match my CV You are Menu  You are  Investor, shareholder Corporate, Institutional Job applicant Individual, professional Supplier Journalist mabanque.bnpparibas BNP Paribas worldwide Cookies settings Legal notices Data Protection Cookie policy Accessibility : partially compliant Sitemap FR EN Click to display the search engine What are you searching?  Close search Home The Group Our governance General Management and the Executive Committee Our governance General Management and Executive Committee  The General Management of BNP Paribas is composed of a Chief Executive Officer (CEO) plus two Chief Operating Officers and three Deputy Chief Operating Officers.  As Chief Executive Officer, Jean-Laurent Bonnafé bears responsibility for the management of the Group and, for this purpose, is invested with extensive powers. Accordingly, all operational activities and Group functions fall under his direct responsibility.   The Executive Committee brings together the General Management as well as 14 other members - Heads of businesses and central functions. They meet at least once a week.   Close the biography Jean-Laurent Bonnafé Director and Chief Executive Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Yann Gérardin Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas and Executive Chairman of Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking (CIB) Biography Thierry Laborde Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services (CPBS) Biography Renaud Dumora Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of Investment &amp; Protection Services (IPS) Biography Yannick Jung Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of the Commercial &amp; Personal Banking businesses in the euro zone within CPBS Biography Olivier Osty Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas and Chief Executive Officer of Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking (CIB) Biography Close the biography Michael Anseeuw Director and Chief Executive Officer and Chairman of the Executive Board of BNP Paribas Fortis Biography Marc Camus Chief Information Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Elena Goitini Chief Executive Officer of BNL</data>
    </edge>
