      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.sanofi.com/en/our-company/governance/board-of-directors</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Sanofi Board of Directors Overview Members of our Board of Directors are appointed for a maximum term of four years - reappointment of Directors is done on a rotation basis. The Board of Directors defines the strategic business guidelines and directions of the Company, and supervises their implementation. Subject to the powers expressly attributed to the Shareholders’ General Meeting, and within the scope of the company’s corporate purpose, the Board of Directors’ powers cover all issues relating to the proper management of the company and through its decisions the Board determines all matters falling within its authority. Composition of the Board of Directors The Board of Directors, appointed by the shareholders, is composed of 16 members, two of whom are employee representatives. Frédéric Oudéa Chairman of the Board of Directors Term expires 2027 See more Belén Garijo Director Term expires 2030 See more Christophe Babule Director Term expires 2030 See more Clotilde Delbos Independent director Term expires 2027 See more Humberto De Sousa Director representing employees (designated by the French Democratic Confederation of Labour – CFDT) Term expires 2029 See more Rachel Duan Independent director Term expires 2028 See more Carole Ferrand Independent director Term expires 2029 See more Christel Heydemann Independent director Term expires 2030 See more Lise Kingo Independent director Term expires 2028 See more Jean-Paul Kress Independent director Term expires 2030 See more Wolfgang Laux Director representing employees (designated by the European Works Council) Term expires 2029 See more Barbara Lavernos Director Term expires 2029 See more Anne-Françoise Nesmes Independent director Term expires 2027 See more John Sundy Independent director Term expires 2027 See more Emile Voest Independent director</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e659" source="emilio-gayo-rodriguez" target="telefonica">
      <data key="e_predicate">board_member</data>
