      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.telefonica.com/en/shareholders-investors/corporate-governance/board-of-directors</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Telefonica official governance page Skip to content Buscar Close Share in shareholders &amp; investors ES EN Search About us Sustainability and Innovation Services Communication room Shareholders and Investors Employment Home Shareholders &amp; Investors Corporate Governance Board of Directors  Pursuant to Telefónica’s Corporate Bylaws, the administration of the company falls to the Board of Directors, its Chairman, Executive Commission and, if any, one or several CEOs.  Composition of the Board of Directors  The Board of Directors will be composed of at least five and no more than twenty Board Members appointed by the General Shareholder’s Meeting. Board Members will serve for a term of four years and may be re-elected one or more times for terms of the same duration. Currently, the Board of Directors is composed of fifteen Board Members, plus a Secretary and a Vice Secretary whom are not Board Members.  Mr. Marc Thomas Murtra Millar  Executive Chairman Executive Director First appointment: 18-01-2025 Last appointment: 10-04-2025  Show Curriculum Mr. Isidro Fainé Casas  Vice-Chairman Proprietary Director (1) First appointment: 26-01-1994 Last appointment: 12-04-2024  Show Curriculum Mr. Carlos Ocaña Orbis  Vice Chairman Proprietary Director (2) First appointment: 08-05-2024 Last appointment: 10-04-2025  Show Curriculum Mr. Emilio Gayo Rodríguez  Chief Operating Officer (COO)</data>
    </edge>
