      <data key="e_quote">Ericsson uses cookies and related technologies to analyze site usage, improve your experience, and to personalize content and ads. For more information on how we use cookies and to control your cookie choices, please see below or visit our cookie policy. Accept allAccept necessary onlyView options Privacy notice | Legal notice Skip navigation Our solutions Insights Industries About us Investors Careers AUT Sign in Search Suggested searches Home About us Corporate governance Board of Directors Board members Skip left navigation About us Company facts Industry vision Our Compass (CoBE) Corporate governance Diversity and inclusion Sustainability and corporate responsibility Sourcing Security Academia collaborations Ericsson history Board members Available in: English Svenska  Board members elected by the Annual General Meeting of shareholders 2026  Jan Carlson  Chair of the Board of Directors since 2023. Chair of the Finance Committee and of the Remuneration Committee. Member of the Board of Directors since 2017.  Jacob Wallenberg  Deputy Chair of the Board of Directors, member of the Finance Committee. Member of the Board of Directors since 2011.  Jon Fredrik Baksaas  Chair of the Enterprise Business and Technology Committee, member of the Audit and Compliance Committee. Member of the Board of Directors since 2017.  Christian Cederholm  Member of the Board of Directors since 2025.  Eric A. Elzvik  Chair of the Audit and Compliance Committee. Member of the Board of Directors</data>
