      <data key="e_quote">AXA or its partners for the purposes set out below.  You are free to accept or refuse these cookies. We will keep your choice for 6 months.  You can adjust your choices according to the categories of cookies now, by clicking on "Personalise my choices" below; or at any time, by clicking on the "Cookie Preference Center" link available at the bottom of each page of the site.  AXA and its 4 partners use cookies for the following purposes:  cookies for analysis or audience measurement, in order to measure the number of visits, number of pages viewed to establish statistics based on the use of our website. Targeting cookies , to display personalized advertising based on your browsing and profile. Functionalities cookies (non strictly necessary), in order to offer enhanced functionality and personalization on our website.  CONSULT OUR LIST OF PARTNERS AND OUR COOKIE POLICY  ACCEPT ALL REJECT ALL PERSONALIZE MY CHOICES CONTINUER SANS ACCEPTER Skip to main content Skip to footer  AXA  42.910  ( +0.73%)  AXA WORLDWIDE EN FR About Us Commitments News Investors Press Careers ABOUT US Members of the Board of Directors  Meet the members of our Board of Directors and find out more about their directorship, experience and expertise.  Composition of the Board of Directors on April 30, 2026.  ANTOINE GOSSET-GRAINVILLE  CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  THOMAS BUBERL  CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA  MARTINE BIÈVRE  DIRECTOR OF AXA REPRESENTING THE EMPLOYEES  HELEN BROWNE  DIRECTOR OF AXA REPRESENTING THE EMPLOYEES SHAREHOLDERS  PHILOMENA COLATRELLA  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  BETTINA CRAMM  DIRECTOR OF AXA REPRESENTING THE EMPLOYEES  CLOTILDE DELBOS  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  GUILLAUME FAURY  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  RAMON FERNANDEZ  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  GÉRALD HARLIN  DIRECTOR OF AXA  ANGELIEN KEMNA  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  RACHEL PICARD  DIRECTOR OF AXA (INDEPENDENT)  EWOUT STEENBERGEN  DIRECTOR OF AX