      <data key="e_quote">Safran  We value your privacy  We use cookies to enhance your browsing experience, serve personalised ads or content, and analyse our traffic. By clicking "Accept All", you consent to our use of cookies.  Customise Reject All Accept All Necessary Functional Analytics Performance Advertisement Save My Preferences Skip to main content SAF 287.2€ +4.17% Countries Locations Companies Graphic guidelines EN Logins Open search GROUP SUSTAINABILITY PRODUCTS &amp; SERVICES CAREERS FINANCE NEWS &amp; MEDIA Home Group Profile Governance Governance  Safran is a French-registered company, listed on NYSE Euronext Paris. Its share is part of the CAC 40 French stock market index, and of the European market index, Euro Stoxx 50. An Executive Committee representing the Group's different businesses implements the strategic objectives defined by the Board of Directors. This governance principle guarantees a balance of power, and ensures Safran’s agility to meet the changing requirements of its economic, financial and competitive environment.  Ross McInnes, Chairman of the Board of Safran, and Olivier Andriès, Chief Executive Officer of Safran Board of Directors  Ross McInnes  Group Chairman of the Board  SEE PROFILE  Olivier Andriès  Safran Chief Executive Officer and Director  SEE PROFILE  Anne Aubert  Group Director representing employee shareholders  SEE PROFILE  Valérie Baudson  Group Independent Director, Member and Chair of the Appointments and Compensation Committee  SEE PROFILE  Fabrice Brégier  Group Independent Director, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee  SEE PROFILE  Anne Bouverot  Group Independant Director, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee  SEE PROFILE  Christèle Debarenne-Fievet  Group Director representing employees, Member of the Appointments and Compensation Committee  SEE PROFILE  Pascale Dosda  Group Director representing employee shareholders  SEE PROFILE  Laurent Guillot  Group Independant Director, Member and Chair of the Audit and Risk Committee, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee  SEE PROFILE  Ivan Hardouin  Group Director representing employees, Member of the Audit and Risk Committee, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee  SEE PROFILE  Guillemette Kreis  French State Representative, Member of the Audit and Risk Committee, Member of the Appointments and Compensation Committee  SEE PROFILE  Alexandre Lahousse  Group Director proposed by the French State, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee  SEE PROFILE  Fabienne Lecorvaisier  Group Independent Director, Member of the Audit and Risk Committee, Member of the Innovation, Technology &amp; Climate Committee, Member of the Appointments and Compensation Committee</data>
    </edge>
