      <data key="e_quote">SAP Investor Relations Ihre Einstellungen zu Cookies für diese Website  Diese Website verwendet Cookies und verwandte Technologien entsprechend der Beschreibung in unserer Cookie-Erklärung, u. A. zum fehlerfreien Betrieb, zur Analyse, für eine verbesserte Benutzerfreundlichkeit oder zu Werbezwecken. Sie können unserer Verwendung dieser Technologien zustimmen oder Ihre eigenen Präferenzen verwalten.  Datenschutzerklärung | Cookie-Erklärung  Alle annehmen Alle ablehnen Einstellungen verwalten Skip to Content Financial Documents &amp; EventsStockNewsGovernance &amp; SustainabilityInvestor ResourcesExplore SAP Contact Us / Governance &amp; Sustainability Supervisory Board Members Committees Profile of Skills and Expertise Qualification Matrix Meeting Participation SAP SE Corporate Governance  SAP SE Supervisory Board  The SAP SE Supervisory Board advises and supervises the Executive Board. The number of members in and the composition of the Supervisory Board are determined by the Articles of Incorporation and the Agreement of the Involvement of the European Employees in SAP SE. SAP's Supervisory Board currently comprises nine members elected by the shareholders at their General Meeting and nine members representing the European employees of the SAP group.  Dr. h. c. mult. Pekka Ala-Pietilae  Chairman of the Supervisory Board SAP SE Chairperson of the Board of Directors of HERE Technologies B.V., Amsterdam, Netherlands  Year of Birth: 1957  Nationality: Finnish  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2027  Learn more about Dr. h. c. mult. Pekka Ala-Pietilae  Lars Lamadé  Deputy Chairperson of the Supervisory Board of SAP SE  Additional Position: Head of Global Sponsorships  Year of Birth: 1971  Nationality: German  First elected: 2002  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Lars Lamadé  Jakub Černý  Demand Manager  Year of Birth: 1982  Nationality: Czech  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Jakub Černý  Pascal Demat  Solution Advisor HCM Member of the SAP SE Works Council (Europe)  Year of Birth: 1967  Nationality: Belgian  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Pascal Demat  Marielle Ehrmann  SVP, Chief Security Officer  Year of Birth: 1983  Nationality: German  First elected: 2026  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Marielle Ehrmann  Aicha Evans  Chief Executive Officer and Member of the Board of Directors, Zoox, Inc., Foster City, California, USA  Year of Birth: 1969  Nationality: U.S. American  First appointed: 2017  Term expires: 2028  Learn more about Aicha Evans  Michael Gregoire  Co-founder and partner of Brighton Park Capital, New York City, New York, USA  Year of Birth: 1965  Nationality: U.S. American and Canadian  First elected: 2026  Term expires: 2030  Learn more about Michael Gregoire  Andreas Hahn  Chairperson of the SAP SE Works Council (Europe) Member of the Works Council of SAP SE Board Member of the trade union “ver.di”’s group at SAP Product Expert Digital Supply Chain Standards  Year of Birth: 1971  Nationality: German  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about Andreas Hahn  Prof. Dr. Ralf Herbrich  Honorary Professor of Artificial Intelligence and Energy, Tübingen AI Center, Tübingen Co-Founder and CTO, Brenniq GmbH, Berlin Co-Founder and Managing Director, KI und Gesellschaft gGmbH, Berlin  Year of Birth: 1974  Nationality: German  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2028  Learn more about Prof. Dr. Ralf Herbrich  Jennifer Xin-Zhe Li  General Partner and founding partner of Changcheng Investment Partners, Beijing, China  Year of Birth: 1967  Nationality: Canadian  First elected: 2022  Term expires: 2027  Learn more about Jennifer Xin-Zhe Li  Dr. Qi Lu  Founder &amp; Chief Executive Officer, MiraclePlus Ltd., Beijing, China (not publicly listed company)  Year of Birth: 1961  Nationality: U.S. American  First appointed: 2020  Term expires: 2027  Learn more about Dr. Qi Lu  César Martin  SAP EMEA Enterprise Architect Chairperson of the SAP Spain Works Council Member of the SAP SE Works Council (Europe)  Year of Birth: 1972  Nationality: Spanish  First elected: 2024  Term expires: 2029  Learn more about César Martin  René Obermann  Chairman of the Board of Directors of Airbus SE, Leiden, Netherlands, and Chairman Europe, Warburg Pincus Deutschland GmbH, Berlin, Germany  Year of Birth: 1963  Nationality: German  First elected: 2026  Term expires: 2030  Learn more about René Obermann  Dr. Friederike Rotsch  Lead Independent Director of SAP SE Supervisory Board</data>
