      <data key="e_quote">unilever.com/our-company/our-leadership/ TITLE: Our leadership | Unilever RETRIEVED: 2026-11-02 (rendered text obtained via r.jina.ai; direct request from this network returns HTTP 403)  Skip to content [](https://www.unilever.com/) Menu 1. Home 2. Our company 3. Current page:Our leadership [](https://www.unilever.com/our-company/our-leadership/#) # Our leadership Our international leadership team drives our company, guides our strategy and leads our people. Learn more about our Unilever Leadership Executive (ULE) and the Board of Directors. ## Unilever Leadership Executive (ULE) ### Fernando Fernandez Chief Executive Officer ### Srinivas Phatak Chief Financial Officer ### Eduardo Campanella Business Group President, Home Care ### Reginaldo Ecclissato President, 1 Unilever Markets ### Fabian Garcia Business Group President, Personal Care ### Prakash Kakkad Chief Legal Officer and Group Company Secretary ### Priya Nair Chief Executive Officer &amp; Managing Director, Hindustan Unilever Limited ### Mairéad Nayager Chief People Officer ### Heiko Schipper Business Group President, Foods</data>
