      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.danone.com/group/about-us/governance.html</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Danone  contenu Menu Footer Group Brands Innovation Newsroom Investors Careers BN 66.18€ +1.01% Investors Global | EN Search Home Group About Us Governance Governance  Governance is essential for good management and a strategic tool. It ensures not only compliance with regulations, but also the vitality of the business plan, its vision, and its ambitions. According to Danone, governance is based on the implementation of an effective decision-making process, steering with the company's stakeholders, and an evaluation system.  It includes the procedures, rules, and structures that are put in place to ensure transparency in its operations and a balance of power between shareholders, directors, and executives, as well as employees, suppliers, and customers.  Contents  Board of Directors Executive Committee By-laws, rules of procedure of the Board of Directors and business conduct policies Corporate Officers Compensation Governance engagement presentations Regulated Party Agreements Board of Directors Gilles Schnepp Read bio Valérie Chapoulaud-Floquet Read bio Antoine de Saint-Affrique Chief Executive Officer Read bio Frédéric Boutebba Read bio Gilbert Ghostine Read bio Lise Kingo Read bio Patrice Louvet Read bio Sanjiv Mehta Read bio Géraldine Picaud Read bio Susan Roberts Read bio Bettina Theissig Read bio Composition of Board of Directors Committees  Nomination, Compensation, and Governance Committee: Valérie Chapoulaud-Floquet (Chair and Lead Independent Director), Frédéric Boutebba, and Patrice Louvet  Audit Committee: Géraldine Picaud (Chair), Gilbert Ghostine, and Sanjiv Mehta  CSR Committee: Lise Kingo (Chair), Gilbert Ghostine, Susan Roberts, and Bettina Theissig  Executive Committee Antoine de Saint-Affrique Chief Executive Officer Read bio Juergen Esser Group Deputy CEO, in charge of Finance, Technology and Data Read bio Véronique Penchienati-Bosetta Group Deputy CEO, in charge of geographies and categories Read bio Vikram Agarwal Chief Operations Officer Read bio Henri Bruxelles President Americas</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e798" source="henri-poupart-lafarge" target="societe-generale">
      <data key="e_predicate">board_member</data>
