      <data key="e_quote">santander.com/en/about-us/our-board STATUS: 200  ABOUT US OUR APPROACH SHAREHOLDERS AND INVESTORS PRESS ROOM CAREERS Santander Share MAD 10,35€ +2.29% 16:24 Santander Menu Search nuestro-consejo shares of stock Share Home About us Key facts and figures Our model Our culture Our brand Our board Our history About us  MORE Our approach Supporting the transition to a sustainable economy Our customers’ financial health and inclusion Education, employability and entrepreneurship Education Employability Entrepreneurship Other community support initiatives MORE Data &amp; Artificial Intelligence Policies, reports, data pack and ESG ratings  MORE Shareholders and investors Santander Share Price Historical share prices Shareholder remuneration Investment calculator Presence in indexes Coverage Analysts consensus Capital transactions Share capital distribution MORE Financial and economic information Relevant information Quarterly Results Quarterly Shareholder Report Annual Report Pillar 3 disclosures report Filings with other regulatory bodies TLAC Disclosure MORE Fixed-Income Fixed-Income Presentations Ratings Debt Issuances Programmes Securitisation Issuance Companies Financial Statements Securities Registration Document MORE Corporate Events General Shareholders’ Meeting Investor Day Agenda MORE General Information Institutional presentation Sustainability Presentation Other presentations Shareholders Contact Investors Contact Universal Registration Document Significant equity shareholdings and treasury stock Capital increase in conection with the acquisition of Webster History of Corporate Operations Offer to acquire outstanding shares and ADSs of Banco Santander Mexico (February 2023) MORE FAQs Historical Information of Webster MORE Corporate governance Corporate governance deck Bylaws Annual report on corporate governance Committees' reports Annual report on directors' remuneration Policy on Communication and Engagement with Shareholders and Inv