      <data key="e_quote">AXA or its partners for the purposes set out below.  You are free to accept or refuse these cookies. We will keep your choice for 6 months.  You can adjust your choices according to the categories of cookies now, by clicking on "Personalise my choices" below; or at any time, by clicking on the "Cookie Preference Center" link available at the bottom of each page of the site.  AXA and its 4 partners use cookies for the following purposes:  cookies for analysis or audience measurement, in order to measure the number of visits, number of pages viewed to establish statistics based on the use of our website. Targeting cookies , to display personalized advertising based on your browsing and profile. Functionalities cookies (non strictly necessary), in order to offer enhanced functionality and personalization on our website.  CONSULT OUR LIST OF PARTNERS AND OUR COOKIE POLICY  ACCEPT ALL REJECT ALL PERSONALIZE MY CHOICES CONTINUER SANS ACCEPTER Skip to main content Skip to footer  AXA  42.910  ( +0.73%)  AXA WORLDWIDE EN FR About Us Commitments News Investors Press Careers ABOUT US Members of the Management Committee  Meet our Management Committee and see how it assists the Chief Executive Officer with the operational management of the Group.  THOMAS BUBERL  CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA  GEORGE STANSFIELD  GROUP DEPUTY CEO, GENERAL SECRETARY, OVERSIGHT OF AXA JAPAN, AXA GREATER CHINA (CHINA AND HONG KONG)  GUILLAUME BORIE  GLOBAL HEAD OF FINANCE, STRATEGY, UNDERWRITING, RISK AND TECHNOLOGY  HELEN BROWNE  DIRECTOR OF AXA REPRESENTING THE EMPLOYEES SHAREHOLDERS  MATTHIEU CAILLAT  GROUP CHIEF TECHNOLOGY &amp; AI OFFICER, CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA GROUP OPERATIONS  PATRICK COHEN  CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA EUROPEAN MARKETS &amp; HEALTH  ULRIKE DECOENE  GROUP CHIEF COMMUNICATION, BRAND &amp; SUSTAINABILITY OFFICER  HASSAN EL-SHABRAWISHI  CEO INTERNATIONAL MARKETS (AFRICA, TURKEY, MIDDLE EAST, LATIN AMERICA, THAILAND, INDONESIA, PHILIPPINES, INDIA LIFE)  FRANÇOISE GILLES  GROUP CHIEF RISK OFFICER  SCOTT GUNTER  CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA XL  MATHIEU GODART  CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF AXA FRANCE  ALBAN DE MAILLY NESLE  GROUP CHIEF FINANCIAL OFFICER  ASTRID PANOSYAN-BOUVET  GROUP CHIEF HUMAN RESOURCES OFFICER  KARIMA SILVENT  DEPUTY GENERAL SECRETARY, IN CHARGE OF HUMAN RESOURCES, COMPLIANCE, AUDIT, AXA ESSENTIALL AND GIE AXA</data>
