or the AI era, bringing global leadership across fixed, mobile, and transport networks. Newsroom Multimedia-rich media hub showcasing the latest news and insights from across Nokia. Careers Expand your bubble and search for opportunities. Events Explore upcoming and past events. In this section: About Nokia Careers Events Investors Leadership and governance Newsroom Sustainability Responsible business Select your country We have limited content available for some countries. Find office information and country specific information through our country hub. Worldwide (English) Suomi (Finland) Offices and country specific information Back Main content Home We Are Nokia Leadership and Governance Meet The Board Home ... We Are Nokia Leadership and Governance Meet The Board Meet the board Meet the board Overview Leadership Group leadership team Board of directors Board and executive remuneration Transaction reporting Governance Auditors Corporate governance Disclosure principles Risk Management General meeting Policies Timo Ihamuotila Chair of the Board of Directors Thomas Saueressig Vice Chair of the Board of Directors Timo Ahopelto Member of the Board of Directors Elizabeth Crain Member of the Board of Directors Thomas Dannenfeldt Member of the Board of Directors Pernille Erenbjerg Member of the Board of Directors Lisa Hook Member of the Board of Directors</data>
