s Board meetings and “in camera” sessions where the Chair is not present or conflicted. (e) Based on past and present professional experience. (*) Hanne de Mora passed away on June 26, 2025. The Board wishes to express its gratitude for her important contributions and will treasure her memory.     6                                                                                                                             Corporate Governance Report 2025 Board of Directors     Sector                                  Classification                      Nationality      First election   Expires (b) Retail                                  Finance/Legal/                      Spanish          April 07, 2018   2026                                         FMCG/CEO  Food Retail,                            FMCG/CEO/Sustainability (e)         Dutch            April 11, 2019   2026 Digital  Economic Affairs,                       Governmental/                       Swiss            April 20, 2023   2026 Geopolitics and Trade                   Diplomacy/                                         International Business/                                         Sustainability (e) Finance                                 Financial Management/CFO            Swiss            April 16, 2015   2026    Science                                 Scientist                           Swiss            April 16, 2015   2026                                         Sustainability (e)  Technology,                             Technology/CEO/M&amp;A/                 US/Indian        April 11, 2019   2026 Digital,                                Sustainability (e) Finance Agriculture, Sustainable                Public Policy/Sustainability (e)/   Zimbabwean       April 15, 2021   2026 Food Systems                            Academia  Digital, Communications,                Brand Marketing/                    Malaysian        April 07, 2022   2026 Retail, Energy Management               Digital Customer   