      <data key="e_quote">Anheuser-Busch InBev official governance page URL: https://www.ab-inbev.com/about-us-our-leaders TITLE: Leaders | AB InBev  About Us Reasons We Love Beer Brands Investors News &amp; Media Careers Sustainability Smart Drinking Our website, like our beers, is strictly for those old enough to legally enjoy it.  Enter your birthday below  Location Month Day Year Enter Enjoy Responsibly  By submitting this form, you agree to be bound by  the Terms of Service and Privacy Policy  PRIVACY POLICY TERMS &amp; CONDITIONS DO NOT SELL MY PERSONAL INFORMATION  © 2026 Anheuser-Busch Companies LLC, St. Louis, MO 63118  ﻿Our leaders  Michel Doukeris Global Chief Executive Officer Thiago Porto Global Chief People Officer Fernando Tennenbaum Global Chief Financial Officer John Blood Global Chief Legal &amp; Corporate Affairs Officer Donna Lorenson Global Chief Communications Officer Ricardo Tadeu Global Chief Growth Officer Marcel Marcondes Global Chief Marketing Officer Ricardo Moreira Global Chief Supply Officer David Almeida Global Chief Strategy and Technology Officer Katherine Barrett Global General Counsel Nick Caton Global Chief B2B Officer Lucas Herscovici Global Chief Direct-to-Consumer Officer</data>
