      <data key="e_quote">Maersk’s Executive Leadership team and our Board of Directors. Board of directorsInvestor relations Our Executive Leadership Team Vincent Clerc Executive Board Member and Chief Executive Officer (CEO). Robert Erni Executive Board Member and Chief Financial Officer (CFO). Navneet Kapoor Chief Technology and Information Officer (CTIO). Roberta Duarte Chief People Officer (CPO). Caroline Pontoppidan Chief Corporate Affairs Officer. Katharina Poehlmann Senior Vice President and Head of Strategy. Karsten Kildahl Chief Commercial Officer (CCO). Also responsible for Europe, Latin America and IMEA regions. Bruno Plantaz Global Head of Solutions Christoph Hemmann Global Head of Forwarding. Ditlev Blicher Regional President for North America. Keith Svendsen Chief Executive Officer (CEO) of APM Terminals. Johan Sigsgaard Chief Product Officer (CPO) – Ocean. Rabab Boulos Chief Operating Officer (COO). Scott Andrew Elliott Regional President for Asia Pacific Board of Directors A.P. Moller - Maersk management is organised around a two-tier system, with a Board of Directors with a supervisory role and an Executive Board responsible for overall operations, financial results and business growth. Learn more about our Board of Directors here. Robert Maersk Uggla Chair of the Board of Directors, chair of the Nomination Committee, member of the Remuneration Committee and member of the Energy Transition Committee. Marc Engel Vice chair of the Board of Directors</data>
