      <data key="e_doc_id">official-intesa-sanpaolo-board</data>
      <data key="e_doc_title">official-intesa-sanpaolo-board</data>
      <data key="e_doc_path">sources/official/intesa-sanpaolo-board.txt</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://group.intesasanpaolo.com/en/governance/bod</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Intesa Sanpaolo, at the ordinary meeting held on 29 April 2025, decided to set the number of the members of the Board of Directors at 19 and, in accordance with the provisions of Article 14 of the Articles of Association, appointed the Board of Directors for financial years 2025/2026/2027, electing Gian Maria Gros-Pietro Chair and Paola Tagliavini Deputy Chair. Furthermore, the Shareholders appointed five members of the Board of Directors to the Management Control Committee, with Roberto Franchini as Chair.  In accordance with the Articles of Association, candidates appointed have been drawn from the slates submitted by shareholders owning at least 0.5% of the Bank’s ordinary share capital. The candidates have declared their compliance with the requirements of professionalism, integrity, independence, competence, fairness, time commitment, and the limits on the total number of directorships prescribed by the law and the current regulations.  The Board of Directors is currently composed as follows:   NAME POSITION CV  DATE OF BIRTH DATE OF APPOINTMENT   AUDITOR (#)     INDEPENDENT (##)   MANAGEMENT CONTROL COMMITTEE   Gian Maria Gros-Pietro Chair  PDF 62 Kb  04/02/1942 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Paola Tagliavini Deputy Chair  PDF 69 Kb  23/10/1968 29/04/2025     -  Carlo Messina (*) Managing Director and CEO  PDF 21 Kb  06/04/1962 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Mariangela Zappia Director  PDF 50 Kb  12/08/1959 29/04/2025 -  -  Franco Ceruti Director  PDF 42 Kb  13/06/1952 29/04/2025 - - -  Paolo Maria Vittorio Grandi Director  PDF 65 Kb  07/11/1954  29/04/2025 -  -  Luciano Nebbia Director  PDF 25 Kb  01/09/1953 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Liana Logiurato Director  PDF 56 Kb  29/03/1968 29/04/2025 - -  Pietro Previtali Director  PDF 48 Kb  27/03/1971 29/04/2025 -  -  Maria Alessandra Stefanelli Director  PDF 63 Kb  27/01/1964 29/04/2025 -    -  Bruno Maria Parigi Director  PDF 52 Kb  21/12/1957 29/04/2025 -    -  Anna Gatti (1) Director  PDF 61 Kb  30/01/1972 29/04/2025 - -  Guido Celona (1) Director  PDF 52 Kb  18/08/1959 29/04/2025 -  Mariarosaria Taddeo (1) Director</data>
    </edge>
