      <data key="e_doc_path">sources/official/renault.txt</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.renaultgroup.com/en/group/leadership/board-of-directors/</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Renault Group Presentation of the Board of Directors Board of Directors The Board of Directors of Renault Group is responsible for management and strategic direction. Members are appointed by the Annual General Meeting, with the exception of the director appointed by the French government and the directors representing employees. The Board of Directors currently has 16 members, as follows: 3 directors elected by employees 12 directors appointed by the General Meeting of Shareholders, including: 2 directors proposed by Nissan, 1 proposed by employee shareholders and 1 by the French government 1 director appointed by government order to represent the French State Jean-Dominique Senard Chairman of the Board of Directors See full bio about Jean-Dominique Senard François Provost Chief Executive Officer and Director See full bio about François Provost Michelle Baron Director appointed upon proposal of Nissan See full bio about Michelle Baron Virginie Cayet Director elected by employees See full bio about Virginie Cayet Miriem Bensalah Chaqroun Independent director See full bio about Miriem Bensalah Chaqroun Anne-Laure de Chammard Independent director See full bio about Anne-Laure de Chammard Bernard Delpit Independent director See full bio about Bernard Delpit Noël Desgrippes Director elected upon proposal of the employee shareholders See full bio about Noël Desgrippes Armelle de Madre Independent director See full bio about Armelle de Madre Marie-José Donsion Independent Director</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e1094" source="marie-josee-kravis" target="lvmh">
      <data key="e_predicate">board_member</data>
      <data key="e_edge_class">network</data>
      <data key="e_role">board_member</data>
      <data key="e_grade">A</data>
      <data key="e_n_sources">1</data>
      <data key="e_doc_id">official-lvmh</data>
      <data key="e_doc_title">LVMH Board of Directors</data>
      <data key="e_doc_path">sources/official/lvmh.txt</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://www.lvmh.com/en/our-group/governance</data>
      <data key="e_quote">LVMH Governance &amp; Ethics Consult the Profiles of members of the LVMH Executive Committee and Board of Directors, as well as the rules of conduct and action principles to guide the behavior of all Group’s employees and stakeholders. EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE BOARD OF DIRECTORS EXECUTIVE COMMITTEE The LVMH Executive Committee comprises executives who head the Group's operational and functional entities. It defines strategic objectives aligned with the directions set by the Board of Directors, and coordinates their implementation. The Executive Committee also ensures that the organization adapts to changes in the business environment and establishes the responsibilities and delegations of authority allocated to executives, along with the execution of these responsibilities. OUR ETHICS &amp; COMPLIANCE APPROACH Every action taken by the Group and its employees reflects LVMH’s commitment to ethics and social and environmental responsibility. Committed to the highest standards in this area, the Group has defined rules of conduct and principles of action that guide the day-to-day behavior of its employees and all its stakeholders. READ BOARD OF DIRECTORS The Board of Directors formulates the strategy of the Group, placing priority on increasing the value of the company and protecting the company's interests. Its primary missions are to establish the major strategic directions of the Group and monitor their implementation, verify the fair and accurate presentation of information about the Group, and protect its corporate assets. MEMBERS OF BOARD OF DIRECTORS Bernard Arnault Chairman &amp; Chief Executive Officer Alexandre Arnault Antoine Arnault Delphine Arnault Frédéric Arnault Dominique Aumont Director representing employees Henri de Castries¹ Lead Director Sophie Chassat¹ Wei Sun Christianson¹ Clara Gaymard¹ Ariane Gorin¹ Marie-Josée Kravis</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e1095" source="mariella-tagliabue" target="intesa-sanpaolo">
      <data key="e_predicate">board_member</data>
      <data key="e_edge_class">network</data>
      <data key="e_role">board_member</data>
      <data key="e_grade">A</data>
      <data key="e_n_sources">1</data>
      <data key="e_doc_id">official-intesa-sanpaolo-board</data>
      <data key="e_doc_title">official-intesa-sanpaolo-board</data>
      <data key="e_doc_path">sources/official/intesa-sanpaolo-board.txt</data>
      <data key="e_source_url">https://group.intesasanpaolo.com/en/governance/bod</data>
      <data key="e_quote">Intesa Sanpaolo, at the ordinary meeting held on 29 April 2025, decided to set the number of the members of the Board of Directors at 19 and, in accordance with the provisions of Article 14 of the Articles of Association, appointed the Board of Directors for financial years 2025/2026/2027, electing Gian Maria Gros-Pietro Chair and Paola Tagliavini Deputy Chair. Furthermore, the Shareholders appointed five members of the Board of Directors to the Management Control Committee, with Roberto Franchini as Chair.  In accordance with the Articles of Association, candidates appointed have been drawn from the slates submitted by shareholders owning at least 0.5% of the Bank’s ordinary share capital. The candidates have declared their compliance with the requirements of professionalism, integrity, independence, competence, fairness, time commitment, and the limits on the total number of directorships prescribed by the law and the current regulations.  The Board of Directors is currently composed as follows:   NAME POSITION CV  DATE OF BIRTH DATE OF APPOINTMENT   AUDITOR (#)     INDEPENDENT (##)   MANAGEMENT CONTROL COMMITTEE   Gian Maria Gros-Pietro Chair  PDF 62 Kb  04/02/1942 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Paola Tagliavini Deputy Chair  PDF 69 Kb  23/10/1968 29/04/2025     -  Carlo Messina (*) Managing Director and CEO  PDF 21 Kb  06/04/1962 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Mariangela Zappia Director  PDF 50 Kb  12/08/1959 29/04/2025 -  -  Franco Ceruti Director  PDF 42 Kb  13/06/1952 29/04/2025 - - -  Paolo Maria Vittorio Grandi Director  PDF 65 Kb  07/11/1954  29/04/2025 -  -  Luciano Nebbia Director  PDF 25 Kb  01/09/1953 29/04/2025 -  -  -  Liana Logiurato Director  PDF 56 Kb  29/03/1968 29/04/2025 - -  Pietro Previtali Director  PDF 48 Kb  27/03/1971 29/04/2025 -  -  Maria Alessandra Stefanelli Director  PDF 63 Kb  27/01/1964 29/04/2025 -    -  Bruno Maria Parigi Director  PDF 52 Kb  21/12/1957 29/04/2025 -    -  Anna Gatti (1) Director  PDF 61 Kb  30/01/1972 29/04/2025 - -  Guido Celona (1) Director  PDF 52 Kb  18/08/1959 29/04/2025 -  Mariarosaria Taddeo (1) Director  PDF 56 Kb  22/07/1980 29/04/2025 -    -  Fabrizio Mosca Director  PDF 48 Kb  07/06/1968 29/04/2025              Mariella Tagliabue Director</data>
    </edge>
