      <data key="e_quote">Vodafone Business Vodafone Foundation Our sites Link to Homepage Link to everyone.connected page Link to Our company page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to Our impact page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to Investors page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to News page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to page Link to Vodafone Group announces Q1 FY27 Trading Update Link to Careers page Open Search Close Button BOARD OF DIRECTORS Link to Home page Link to Our company page Link to Leadership page Board of Directors Main Content  The Board is responsible for the overall conduct of the Group’s business and has the powers, authorities and duties vested in it by, and pursuant to, the relevant laws of England and Wales and the Articles of Association of Vodafone  Group Plc.  The Board of Directors  The Chair is responsible for the operation, leadership and governance of the Board, ensuring its effectiveness and setting its agenda. The Chief Executive is responsible for the management of the Group’s business and the implementation of Board strategy and policy.  Jean-François van Boxmeer  Chair  Margherita Della Valle  Group Chief Executive  Pilar López  Group Chief Financial Officer  Simon Segars  Independent Non-Executive Director and Senior Independent Director  Stephen A. Carter CBE  Independent Non-Executive Director  Delphine Ernotte Cunci  Independent Non-Executive Director and Workforce Engagement Lead  Michel Demaré  Independent Non-Executive Director</data>
