      <data key="e_quote">SAP SE Ihre Einstellungen zu Cookies für diese Website  Diese Website verwendet Cookies und verwandte Technologien entsprechend der Beschreibung in unserer Cookie-Erklärung, u. A. zum fehlerfreien Betrieb, zur Analyse, für eine verbesserte Benutzerfreundlichkeit oder zu Werbezwecken. Sie können unserer Verwendung dieser Technologien zustimmen oder Ihre eigenen Präferenzen verwalten.  Datenschutzerklärung | Cookie-Erklärung  Alle annehmen Alle ablehnen Einstellungen verwalten Skip to Content ProductsIndustriesTransform and SupportLearningCommunityPartnersAboutExplore SAP Ask Joule Contact us / Company Information / Leadership Extended board Visit our local site for more information and offerings for your country. SAP Österreich Stay on the United States site SAP SE Extended Board  The SAP SE Extended Board plays a key role in driving SAP’s strategy execution. Its members advise, coordinate, and prepare decisions for the SAP SE Executive Board, drive activities delegated to them and represent SAP externally. Decision power remains with the Executive Board, under unchanged corporate governance.  Go-to-market        Ada Agrait  Chief Marketing Officer  Learn more about Ada Agrait  Thomas Pfiester  Head of Customer Engagement &amp; Adoption  Learn more about Thomas Pfiester  Manos Raptopoulos  Global President Customer Success Europe, APAC, Middle East and Africa  Learn more about Manos Raptopoulos  Jan Gilg  Global President Customer Success &amp; Americas  Learn more about Jan Gilg  Product &amp; platform Philipp Herzig  Chief Technology Officer  Learn more about Philipp Herzig  Manoj Swaminathan  President and Chief Product Officer, SAP Autonomous Suite  Learn more about Manoj Swaminathan  Corporate functions Sebastian Behrendt  Head of Global Finance  Learn more about Sebastian Behrendt  Monika Schaller  Chief Communication Officer</data>
