le for the operation, leadership and governance of the Board, ensuring its effectiveness and setting its agenda. The Chief Executive is responsible for the management of the Group’s business and the implementation of Board strategy and policy.  Jean-François van Boxmeer  Chair  Margherita Della Valle  Group Chief Executive  Pilar López  Group Chief Financial Officer  Simon Segars  Independent Non-Executive Director and Senior Independent Director  Stephen A. Carter CBE  Independent Non-Executive Director  Delphine Ernotte Cunci  Independent Non-Executive Director and Workforce Engagement Lead  Michel Demaré  Independent Non-Executive Director  Simon Dingemans  Independent Non-Executive Director  Deborah Kerr  Independent Non-Executive Director  Christine Ramon  Independent Non-Executive Director and Workforce Engagement Lead  Anne-Françoise Nesmes  Independent Non-Executive Director  Olaf Koch  Independent Non-Executive Director</data>
