      <data key="e_quote">Société Générale official governance page Welcome to the Societe Generale group website.  Societe Generale and its partners use cookies or equivalent technologies to ensure the proper functioning and security of the site, to improve your experience, to personalise and improve the performance of advertisements and content, to compile traffic and browsing statistics, and to enable you to share content on social networks.  Some of these cookies are subject to your consent. You can express your choice globally, or set your preferences by cookie purpose. You can change these choices at any time.  View our partners Set up Decline all Accept all Go to main content Facebook Twitter Linkedin Instagram YouTube Homepage Locations 60.84€ (-0.25%) FR | EN The Group Responsibility News and documentation Investors Job applicants Search breadcrumb You are here: Home The Group Governance Board of Directors Governance The Board of Directors  The Board of Directors represents all shareholders. It has fifteen members: thirteen Directors appointed by the Shareholders’ Annual General Meeting, including one representing employee shareholders, and two representing employees in general, directly elected by their peers. A non-voting Director has also been appointed to assist the Board with all matters relating to social and environmental responsibility.  The Board of Directors  The Board of Directors collectively represents all shareholders. It acts in the social interest of the Bank and ensures its proper function. Its missions are to approve strategic guidelines, monitor and ensure their implementation in line with Societe Generale's values, and comply with the highest international standards of governance, ethics and risk management. Its members are chosen for their experience, expertise and independence. The Board of Directors aims to be composed of an equal number of men and women and to reflect diversity.  Filter by name William Connelly Chairman of the Board of Directors Independent Director Company Director See more William Connelly informations Slawomir Krupa  Chief Executive Officer  See more Slawomir Krupa informations Ingrid-Helen Arnold Chief Executive Officer of KAKO GmbH (Germany) Independent Director Company Director Member of the Risk Committee See more Ingrid-Helen Arnold informations Laura Barlow Independent Director Member of the Audit and Internal Control and of the Risk Committee See more Laura Barlow informations Jérôme Contamine Independent Director Company Director Chairman of the Audit and Internal Control Committee and member of the Nomination and Corporate Governance Committee See more Jérôme Contamine informations Diane Côté Independent Director Company Director Member of the Audit and Internal Control Committee and of the Risk Committee See more Diane Côté informations Ulrika Ekman Independent Director Member of the Audit and Internal Control Committee and of the Compensation Committee See more Ulrika Ekman informations Clara Furse Company Director Independent Director Chairwoman of the Risk Committee Member of the Nomination and Corporate Governance Committee See more Clara Furse informations France Houssaye Director Elected by Employees Head of External Business Opportunities, Regional Commercial Department, Rouen (Normandy) Member of the Compensation Committee See more France Houssaye informations Olivier Klein Chief Executive Officer of Lazard Frères Banque Independent Director</data>
    </edge>
