Smith  Independent director (e)                                      62          F                British                               500                                       2  Marianna Nitsch  Independent director (e)                                      57          F                Austrian                              500                                       0  Loïc Rocard  Independent director (e)                                      53          M                French                                500                                       0                                                                                                                                                                                        |4|  Anne-Claire Taittinger  Independent director (e)                                      76          F                French                                612                                       0  Appointed by the trade unions (2)  Anne-Marie Hunot-Schmit                                       61          F                French                                163                                       0                                                                                                                                                                                        |5|  Stéphane Jubault                                              58          M                French                                 14                                       0 (a)   Since September 5, 2023, the French State has appointed its representative on the Board directly by decree, without seeking the approval of the Annual General Meeting of       shareholders (see Article 4-I paragraph 1 of Ordinance No. 2014-948). By decree dated January 29, 2024, Mr. Alexis Zajdenweber succeeded Mr. Emmanuel Moulin as       the State’s new representative on the Board of Directors. (b)   Director(s) proposed by the State (Article 6 of Ordinance No. 2014-948). (c