      <data key="e_quote">BNP Paribas worldwide Online Banking FR EN  The bank for a changing world  Open the navigation menu The Group Menu  The BNP Paribas Group  Find here the essentials on BNP Paribas: governance, strategy, organisation and key figures.  Find out more About us Menu / The BNP Paribas Group About us Company purpose Business model Strategic plan Corporate Philanthropy Company history Tennis Cinema Our businesses and expertise Menu / The BNP Paribas Group Our businesses and expertise Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services Menu / The BNP Paribas Group / Our businesses and expertise Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services Investment &amp; Protection Services Our governance Menu / The BNP Paribas Group Our governance Board of Directors General Management and the Executive Committee Compliance Group positions and sector policies Check out our FAQ page See the page Our commitments Menu  Our commitments  We are committed to make a sustainable and inclusive contribution to the environmental, societal, technological and economic challenges of our time.  Find out more about our commitments Transitions Menu / Our commitments Transitions Energy transition and climate action Natural capital and biodiversity Circular economy Energy efficiency Our experts in sustainable finance Innovation Menu / Our commitments Innovation Customer experience Payment solutions Savings and Investment Menu / Our commitments / Innovation Savings and Investment Data &amp; Artificial Intelligence Beyond banking Open innovation Mobility solutions Inclusion Menu / Our commitments Inclusion Financial and social inclusion Social entrepreneurship Diversity, equality and inclusion Sustainable finance: follow our progress in figures See the page News &amp; Mediaroom News Mediaroom  News &amp; Mediaroom  Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  News Menu  News  Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  See more news Group Innovation &amp; technology Sustainable finance Inclusion Corporate philanthropy See more news Mediaroom Menu  Mediaroom  Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  Discover the Mediaroom Press Releases Essentials Spokespeople Contacts Press release BNP Paribas Group: Results as of 30 September 2026 Careers Menu  Careers  Our ambition ? To build a sustainable future. But we can’t do that without you!  Explore our career space  Want to be part of the change?  Why Join BNP Paribas Choosing the right job for me Let's prepare to apply  Choose your profile  I am a student I am early in my career I am an experienced professional Find my future job Match my CV You are Menu  You are  Investor, shareholder Corporate, Institutional Job applicant Individual, professional Supplier Journalist mabanque.bnpparibas BNP Paribas worldwide Cookies settings Legal notices Data Protection Cookie policy Accessibility : partially compliant Sitemap FR EN Click to display the search engine What are you searching?  Close search Home The Group Our governance General Management and the Executive Committee Our governance General Management and Executive Committee  The General Management of BNP Paribas is composed of a Chief Executive Officer (CEO) plus two Chief Operating Officers and three Deputy Chief Operating Officers.  As Chief Executive Officer, Jean-Laurent Bonnafé bears responsibility for the management of the Group and, for this purpose, is invested with extensive powers. Accordingly, all operational activities and Group functions fall under his direct responsibility.   The Executive Committee brings together the General Management as well as 14 other members - Heads of businesses and central functions. They meet at least once a week.   Close the biography Jean-Laurent Bonnafé Director and Chief Executive Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Yann Gérardin Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas and Executive Chairman of Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking (CIB) Biography Thierry Laborde Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services (CPBS) Biography Renaud Dumora Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of Investment &amp; Protection Services (IPS) Biography Yannick Jung Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas, in charge of the Commercial &amp; Personal Banking businesses in the euro zone within CPBS Biography Olivier Osty Deputy Chief Operating Officer of BNP Paribas and Chief Executive Officer of Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking (CIB) Biography Close the biography Michael Anseeuw Director and Chief Executive Officer and Chairman of the Executive Board of BNP Paribas Fortis Biography Marc Camus Chief Information Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Elena Goitini Chief Executive Officer of BNL Biography Elise Hermant Head of Communications of BNP Paribas Biography Pauline Leclerc-Glorieux Director and Chief Executive Officer of BNP Paribas Cardif Biography Isabelle Loc Head of BNP Paribas Commercial &amp; Personal Banking in France Biography Stéphanie Maarek Chief Compliance Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Lars Machenil Chief Financial Officer of BNP Paribas Biography Philippe Maillard Group Chief Operating Officer</data>
    </edge>
