      <data key="e_quote">Allianz Contacts About us Investor Relations Media Center Jobs Sustainability Economic Research Search Home  About us  Corporate Management  Supervisory Board  Supervisory Board Meet the Supervisory Board members of Allianz SE and read more about their responsibilities. Page Content Shareholder representatives Employee representatives More about the Supervisory Board Shareholder representatives  Dr. Jörg Schneider  Chairman of the Supervisory Board Read more  Prof. Dr. Ralf P. Thomas Vice Chairman of the Supervisory Board Read more  Sophie Boissard Read more  Stephanie Bruce Read more  Rashmy Chatterjee Read more  Dr. Frank Ellenbürger  Read more Employee representatives  Gabriele Burkhardt-Berg Vice Chairwoman of the Supervisory Board Read more  Prof. Dr. Nadine Brandl Read more  Giovanni Battista Comini Read more  Lars Grote Read more  Jean-Claude Le Goaër Read more  Jürgen Lawrenz Read more Members and curricula vitae The Supervisory Board of Allianz SE consists of twelve members divided equally into six shareholder representatives and six employee representatives</data>
