      <data key="e_quote">Siemens Skip to main content Supervisory Board The Supervisory Board of Siemens AG has 20 members. As stipulated by the German Co-determination Act, half of its members represent Company shareholders, and half represent Company employees. Supervisory Board members Jim Hagemann Snabe Chairman Chairman of the Supervisory Board of Siemens AG Member since: October 1, 2013 Biography Jürgen Kerner* First Deputy Chairman Second Chairman of IG Metall Member since: January 25, 2012 Biography Werner Brandt (Dr. rer. pol.) Second Deputy Chairman Second Deputy Chairman of the Supervisory Board of Siemens AG Member since: January 31, 2018 Biography Tobias Bäumler* Chairman of the Central Works Council of Siemens AG Member since: October 16, 2020 Biography Regina E. Dugan</data>
