      <data key="e_quote">Renault Group Presentation of the Board of Directors Board of Directors The Board of Directors of Renault Group is responsible for management and strategic direction. Members are appointed by the Annual General Meeting, with the exception of the director appointed by the French government and the directors representing employees. The Board of Directors currently has 16 members, as follows: 3 directors elected by employees 12 directors appointed by the General Meeting of Shareholders, including: 2 directors proposed by Nissan, 1 proposed by employee shareholders and 1 by the French government 1 director appointed by government order to represent the French State Jean-Dominique Senard Chairman of the Board of Directors See full bio about Jean-Dominique Senard François Provost Chief Executive Officer and Director See full bio about François Provost Michelle Baron Director appointed upon proposal of Nissan See full bio about Michelle Baron Virginie Cayet Director elected by employees See full bio about Virginie Cayet Miriem Bensalah Chaqroun Independent director See full bio about Miriem Bensalah Chaqroun Anne-Laure de Chammard Independent director See full bio about Anne-Laure de Chammard Bernard Delpit Independent director See full bio about Bernard Delpit Noël Desgrippes Director elected upon proposal of the employee shareholders See full bio about Noël Desgrippes Armelle de Madre Independent director See full bio about Armelle de Madre Marie-José Donsion Independent Director See full bio about Marie-José Donsion Richard Gentil Director elected by employees</data>
