      <data key="e_quote">Crédit Agricole S.A. so leans on the values of transparency, responsibility and efficiency, what is translated in the organization and the functioning of the Board of Directors by:  • The very active implication of the directors in the corporate life of the company, as well as in the control of its management and its strategy;  • The will to search for the opening and for the balance in the organization of the powers and the composition of governing bodies;  • The permanent concern to allow each to exercise effectively the responsibilities with the necessary objectivity and the independence, in particular through the quality of the dialogue and the transparency of the information.  Click here to find out more on governance Board of directors - as of 16 June 2026 Specialised committees of board Executive committee - as of November 1st, 2026 Management committee - as of November 1st, 2026 DIRECTORS ELECTED BY THE ANNUAL GENERAL MEETING Eric VIAL Chairman of the Board of Directors Chairman of the Social Engagement Committee Member of the Strategy and Technology Committee and of the Appointments and Governance Committee Raphaël APPERT SAS Rue La Boétie represented by Raphaël Appert Deputy Chairman of the Board of Directors Member of the Strategy and Technology Committee, Societal Commitment Committee and of the Appointments and Governance Committee Franck ALEXANDRE Director Membre of the Societal Commitment Committee Agnès AUDIER Independent Director Chairwoman of the Compensation Committee Member of the Audit Commitee and of the Strategy and Technology Committee Olivier AUFFRAY Director Member of the Strategy and Technology Committee, the Compensation Committee, and the Nomination and Governance Committee Sonia BONNET-BERNARD Independent Director</data>
