      <data key="e_quote">iberdrola.com/about-us/management-team/executives TITLE: Executives - Iberdrola RETRIEVED: 2026-11-02 (text obtained via Google Translate proxy; direct request from this network returns HTTP 403)  Executives - Iberdrola Skip to main content Share: Share: I want to send by email I want to send by email LinkedIn LinkedIn Share in Twitter. Share in Twitter. Share in Facebook. Share in Facebook. Whatsapp Whatsapp Press room Careers en Current language, english es español pt português About us Corporate governance Shareholders and Investors Sustainability Search en Current language, english es español pt português Searching What are you looking for? Search suggestions About us Iberdrola Group Corporate purpose and values Executive Chairman Management team Stakeholders Iberdrola’s history Our brand Networks Transmission Distribution Power Our facilities Hydroelectric power Photovoltaic solar energy Onshore wind Offshore wind Energy storage Nuclear energy Other technologies Products and services Electricity PPAs Electric mobility Photovoltaic self-consumption Aerothermics Decarbonisation Solutions Our locations Iberdrola in Spain Iberdrola in the United Kingdom Iberdrola in the United States Iberdrola in Brazil Iberdrola Energía Internacional Strategic Plan Energy Outlook Our sector Electrification IEA WEO 2025: Electrification: the route to higher profitability and security Our innovation model Innovation in our businesses Digital transformation PERSEO: Startup programme Innovation hubs What is Artificial Intelligence? Corporate governance Ethics and compliance Governance and Sustainability System The Driving Ideas of the Governance and Sustainability System General Shareholders' Meeting Documentation Participation in the Meeting Viewing and Results Shareholder rights and duties Historical (2025-2021) Engagement Space Board of Directors Composition Executive Committee Audit and Risk Supervision Committee Appointments Committee Remuneration Commit