Smith  Independent director (e)                                      62          F                British                               500                                       2  Marianna Nitsch  Independent director (e)                                      57          F                Austrian                              500                                       0  Loïc Rocard  Independent director (e)                                      53          M                French                                500                                       0                                                                                                                                                                                        |4|  Anne-Claire Taittinger  Independent director (e)                                      76          F                French                                612                                       0  Appointed by the trade unions (2)  Anne-Marie Hunot-Schmit                                       61          F                French                                163                                       0                                                                                                                                                                                        |5|  Stéphane Jubault                                              58          M                French                                 14                                       0 (a)   Since September 5, 2023, the French State has appointed its representative on the Board directly by decree, without seeking the approval of the Annual General Meeting of       shareholders (see Article 4-I paragraph 1 of Ordinance No. 2014-948). By decree dated January 29, 2024, Mr. Alexis Zajdenweber succeeded Mr. Emmanuel Moulin as       the State’s new representative on the Board of Directors. (b)   Director(s) proposed by the State (Article 6 of Ordinance No. 2014-948). (c)   The French State owns 2,060 Thales shares directly and 54,786,654 shares indirectly via its 100%-owned subsidiary TSA SAS. Its representative, Mr. Alexis Zajdenweber,           |6|       is not required to hold any share (Article 5 of Ordinance No. 2014-948) and does not hold any. (d)   On February 4, 2025, the Board of Directors co-opted Ms. Valérie Guillemet to the Board for the remainder of the term of Mr. Charles Edelstenne (who stepped down on       January 9, 2025), i.e. until the Annual General Meeting called in 2026 to approve the financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025. This co-option was       ratified by the Annual General Meeting on May 16, 2025. (e)   Independence under the Afep-Medef code, confirmed by the Board of Directors on March 2, 2026. (f)   Of which 4,700 shares held through a holding company controlled by the concerned person.                                                                                         |7|                                                                                                                                                                                           |8|                                                                                                                             2025 Universal Registration Document – Thales             85 4      Governance and compensation      Composition of the Board of Directors          Directors                                       First                      Current term                             Committees*                Attendance in financial       at December 31, 2025                         appointment                                                                                             year 2025                                                                                  Starts Ends                   S&amp;C          A&amp;A         G&amp;C           Number of meetings                                                 