dent Finance, Administration of Sales Region Americas (Woodcliff Lake, NJ, USA) 2021 – 2022: Vice President Assembly Plant Munich 2018 – 2020: Vice President Strategic Planning 2018: Head of Production Concept Midsize BMW 2015: Joined BMW AG, Head of Project Plant Development Mexico (San Luis Potosí, Mexico) 2006 – 2014: Worked in an international strategic consultancy, most recently as Partner 2002 – 2006: Research Associate at the Chair of Aeronautical Engineering of TU Munich; Doctorate in Engineering (Dr. Ing.) 1997 – 2002: Studied Aerospace Engineering at Technical University Munich; Degree: Dipl.-Ing. Supervisory Board of BMW AG. Dr. Nicolas Peter Chairman of the Supervisory Board of BMW AG. Dr. Nicolas Peter  Chairman of the Supervisory Board of BMW AG. Shareholder representative.  Mandate: Member and Chairman since 2025, elected until 2029 Year of birth: 1962 Nationality: German, French  Since 2025: Chairman of the Supervisory Board of BMW AG Since 2025: Member of the Board of Directors and the Audit Committee of BNP Paribas S.A. Since 2023: Member of the Government Commission for the German Corporate Governance Code (GCGC) Since 2020: Chairman of the Board of Trustees of BMW Foundation Herbert Quandt 2023 – 2025: Member of the Board of Directors of FORVIA SE 2023 – 2025: Member of the Supervisory Board of KION Group AG 2017 – 2023: Member of the Board of Management of BMW AG, Finance 2011 – 2016: Head of Region Europe 2007 – 2011: Head of Group Controlling 2005 – 2007: Head of Sales Steering, Process Development and IT 2002 – 2004: Head of BMW Sweden 1999 – 2002: Managing Director Finance and Administration, BMW France 1996 – 1999: Department Head, Risk management, Corporate Finance 1993 – 1996: Treasurer, BMW Coordination Center, Belgium 1991 – 1993: Various management and project management functions 1991: Joined BMW AG 1988 – 1991: Completion of 2nd state legal examination 1989: Ph.D. (Dr. jur.) at the Ludwigs-Maximilians-Universität Munich 1984 – 1988: 