      <data key="e_quote">L'Oréal Group : Executive Committee  GO TO CONTENT GO TO FOOTER Journalists Suppliers Investors &amp; Shareholders stock) OR.PA € 436.05 -0.21% Language Switcher en fr search Groupe Commitments Brands Beauty Science &amp; Technology Careers Executive Committee  A presentation of L’Oréal's Executive Committee through the careers of the people who make up the committee.  L'Oréal Groupe Discover L'Oréal Groupe Governance and Ethics Executive Committee  The Executive Committee is responsible for managing the Group’s various activities in line with the strategic guidelines set out by the Board of Directors. Its members are in charge of operational divisions corporate functions and geographical regions on a global basis.  Nicolas Hieronimus Chief Executive Officer L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Barbara Lavernos Deputy Chief Executive Officer, in charge of Research, Innovation and Technology L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Christophe Babule Chief Financial Officer L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Ezgi Barcenas Chief Corporate Responsibility Officer and General Manager of the Fondation L'Oréal L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Kerstin Bird  President - Sub-Saharan Africa Zone  L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Vincent Boinay President - L’Oréal North Asia Zone and Chief Executive Officer - L’Oréal China L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Cyril Chapuy President - Luxe Division L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Myriam Cohen-Welgryn President - Dermatological Beauty Division  L'Oréal - Linkedin - Open in a new window Vianney Derville  Chief Growth Officer</data>
