      <data key="e_quote">BNP Paribas worldwide Online Banking FR EN  The bank for a changing world  Open the navigation menu The Group Menu  The BNP Paribas Group  Find here the essentials on BNP Paribas: governance, strategy, organisation and key figures.  Find out more About us Menu / The BNP Paribas Group About us Company purpose Business model Strategic plan Corporate Philanthropy Company history Tennis Cinema Our businesses and expertise Menu / The BNP Paribas Group Our businesses and expertise Corporate &amp; Institutional Banking Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services Menu / The BNP Paribas Group / Our businesses and expertise Commercial, Personal Banking &amp; Services Investment &amp; Protection Services Our governance Menu / The BNP Paribas Group Our governance Board of Directors General Management and the Executive Committee Compliance Group positions and sector policies Check out our FAQ page See the page Our commitments Menu  Our commitments  We are committed to make a sustainable and inclusive contribution to the environmental, societal, technological and economic challenges of our time.  Find out more about our commitments Transitions Menu / Our commitments Transitions Energy transition and climate action Natural capital and biodiversity Circular economy Energy efficiency Our experts in sustainable finance Innovation Menu / Our commitments Innovation Customer experience Payment solutions Savings and Investment Menu / Our commitments / Innovation Savings and Investment Data &amp; Artificial Intelligence Beyond banking Open innovation Mobility solutions Inclusion Menu / Our commitments Inclusion Financial and social inclusion Social entrepreneurship Diversity, equality and inclusion Sustainable finance: follow our progress in figures See the page News &amp; Mediaroom News Mediaroom  News &amp; Mediaroom  Our financial results, business activites, solutions and recent sustainable finance initiatives: news, analysis and viewpoints.  News Menu  News 