      <data key="e_quote">SAP Investor Relations Ihre Einstellungen zu Cookies für diese Website  Diese Website verwendet Cookies und verwandte Technologien entsprechend der Beschreibung in unserer Cookie-Erklärung, u. A. zum fehlerfreien Betrieb, zur Analyse, für eine verbesserte Benutzerfreundlichkeit oder zu Werbezwecken. Sie können unserer Verwendung dieser Technologien zustimmen oder Ihre eigenen Präferenzen verwalten.  Datenschutzerklärung | Cookie-Erklärung  Alle annehmen Alle ablehnen Einstellungen verwalten Skip to Content Financial Documents &amp; EventsStockNewsGovernance &amp; SustainabilityInvestor ResourcesExplore SAP Contact Us / Governance &amp; Sustainability Supervisory Board Members Committees Profile of Skills and Expertise Qualification Matrix Meeting Participation SAP SE Corporate Governance  SAP SE Supervisory Board  The SAP SE Supervisory Board advises and supervises the Executive Board. The number of members in and the composition of the Supervisory Board are determined by the Articles of Incorporation and the Agreement of the Involvement of the European Employees in SAP SE. SAP's Supervisory Board currently comprises nine members elected by the shareholders at their General Meeting and nine members representing the European employees of the SAP group.  Dr. h. c. mult. Pekka Ala-Pietilae  Chairman of the Supervisory Board SAP SE</data>
