fficer Pedro has a Degree in Law and Business Administration from the Instituto Católico de Administración y Dirección de Empresas (ICADE) at the Universidad Pontificia de Comillas in Madrid, where he has been imparting his knowledge as professor of Corporate Finance and Mergers and Acquisitions. He was also awarded an MBA from the University of Chicago (United States). Pedro developed his professional career in the Investment Banking division of Morgan Stanley until joining the Iberdrola Group in 1997 as Director of Strategy. He then took on responsibility for Corporate Development activities until 2022, when he was appointed CEO of Iberdrola's subsidiary in the USA. Download image José Sainz Armada CFO Iberdrola's Chief Finance, Control and Corporate Development Officer</data>
