      <data key="e_quote">From 1995-2008 she served as municipal Councillor for Oud-Heverlee, a municipality located in the Belgian province of Flemish Brabant, and in 2001 she became First Alderman for Oud-Heverlee.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e3470" source="marianne-thyssen" target="cd-v">
