      <data key="e_quote">In early March 2020, Gentiloni was appointed by President von der Leyen to serve on the Commission's special task force to coordinate their response to the COVID-19 pandemic, which severely affected the European Union.</data>
    </edge>
    <edge id="e3574" source="paolo-gentiloni" target="federation-of-the-greens">
