      <data key="e_source_url">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Paolo_Gentiloni</data>
      <data key="e_quote">As director of this ecologist newspaper he met the young leader of Federation of the Greens, Francesco Rutelli and became, along with Roberto Giachetti, Michele Anzaldi and Filippo Sensi, a member of the so-called "Rutelli boys", a group formed by Rutelli's closest advisors and supporters.</data>
    </edge>
